{
  "about": "Outlet logos for the sourced-claim animations (caption5) and game logos for the game tag (gametag). build_video.mjs puts an outlet logo in the source chip when the plan names that outlet, and a game logo in the game tag when the plan names that game, if its file is here. Images: transparent PNG, about 1280 px wide; they come with the Algrow download, like the footage. logo_h is the logo height in the chip (about 38 for a wordmark, 30 for a very long one, 61 for a square mark); logo_trim is 14 for a square mark, else 0. A game logo has no logo_h: the game tag sets its width.",
